					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nisi maximopere vererer, ne hoc tempore ad <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>te scribendo negotium tibi facesserem, uberiores <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad te dare non erubescerem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc cum tantis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>negotiorum ponderibus hac praesertim tam tru<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>culenta temporum conditione graveris, unicum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>saltem casum, qui <placeName>Vaienzae</placeName> in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> contigit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>in praesentia memorare audebo.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Vir quidam et generis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>splendore et virtutum praestantia nobilissimus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>cum christianae religionis nomine et suspitione <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>hostibus esset proditus, raptus est in squalidum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>carcerem, diuque in eo asservato acerrima tandem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quaestio fuit decreta, cumque vi tormentorum ad <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>deffectionem adigi non posset, iteratis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quaestionibus sic miserum exercuerunt, ut in ipsis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tormentorum angustiis magno cum eiulatu ex<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>spirarit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Fama tantae tyrannidis precrebescente <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>cives ceu signo dato undique concurrere; furor arma <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ministrare; obvia quaeque arripere, delubra dilacerare, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>aras cum imaginibus evertere inque sacrificulorum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>capita omnia ruere et tendere.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Pars sibi fuga <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>consulere, pedibus alii proteri, plaerique trucidari et <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>expelli; gubernatorem denique ipsum vix evadere, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>et varii generis tumultus et seditiones per totam <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> serpere viresque accquirere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Haec pro <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>certo apud nos scribuntur et dicuntur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">D. Iesus suos <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ex faucibus suorum hostium clementer dignetur <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>eripere ecclesiaeque suae profundam iamque diu ex<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>optatam pacem largiri.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In hoc valere, vir am<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>plissime, aeternum te exopto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curiae</placeName> 1568. 29. martii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Dignitati tuae <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>subiectissimus <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p8016">Th<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>[obi<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>as] <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Eg<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>[<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>li<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>s</persName><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>]<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Amplissimo viro d. m. <lb xml:id="p2z20"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>pa<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>rocho summo, d. <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>suo perpetua <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>fide colen<lb xml:id="p2z32"/>dissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
